{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00188",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.65,
      "end_seconds": 4.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. Can I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.79,
      "end_seconds": 10.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 14.9,
      "end_seconds": 19.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.48,
      "end_seconds": 26.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "I'm here because of blurry vision. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.87,
      "end_seconds": 32.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "How long have you had it? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.08,
      "end_seconds": 39.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "Well, for nearly five years, I'd say. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.45,
      "end_seconds": 48.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "Right, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.67,
      "end_seconds": 60.91,
      "duration_seconds": 11.24,
      "text": "Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. It settles a little with squinting. It's worse with reading. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.95,
      "end_seconds": 63.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Have you had tired eyes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.3,
      "end_seconds": 69.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "Yes, for about a month. I've also had trouble reading small print."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.75,
      "end_seconds": 72.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.98,
      "end_seconds": 80.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly. Headaches after reading was there, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.21,
      "end_seconds": 88.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Have you had any floaters, double vision or eye pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.98,
      "end_seconds": 91.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Well, nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.94,
      "end_seconds": 95.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.89,
      "end_seconds": 100.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Uh, uh, no, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.33,
      "end_seconds": 103.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.87,
      "end_seconds": 106.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Nothing there, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.56,
      "end_seconds": 109.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.91,
      "end_seconds": 125.44,
      "duration_seconds": 14.53,
      "text": "Oh, it's ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning for my blood pressure. My family kept telling me to get it checked. Glimepiride. I take it 2 milligrams, before breakfast for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 126.28,
      "end_seconds": 134.9,
      "duration_seconds": 8.62,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the glimepiride was 4 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.56,
      "end_seconds": 139.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.83,
      "end_seconds": 143.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "No, uh, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.71,
      "end_seconds": 148.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.61,
      "end_seconds": 152.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Right, thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.5,
      "end_seconds": 159.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.17,
      "end_seconds": 169.4,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "So, I've had high blood pressure for nearly five years now. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.62,
      "end_seconds": 171.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.73,
      "end_seconds": 178.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Yes, diabetes. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.67,
      "end_seconds": 181.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Go on. What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.22,
      "end_seconds": 186.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "I had a knee arthroscopy three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.73,
      "end_seconds": 191.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.28,
      "end_seconds": 197.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Yeah, yes, peanuts, it gives me my lips swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.37,
      "end_seconds": 199.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.99,
      "end_seconds": 205.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.15,
      "end_seconds": 207.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.41,
      "end_seconds": 211.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.03,
      "end_seconds": 213.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.07,
      "end_seconds": 222.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.41,
      "end_seconds": 245.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 118 over 77, temp 36.7 degrees, heart rate 86. And oxygen saturation is 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.65,
      "end_seconds": 246.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.76,
      "end_seconds": 254.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.69,
      "end_seconds": 261.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.67,
      "end_seconds": 266.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.91,
      "end_seconds": 270.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.22,
      "end_seconds": 281.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "The lens looks a little cloudy on both sides."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.11,
      "end_seconds": 284.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Look straight ahead for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.32,
      "end_seconds": 304.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Vision without glasses is six over twelve in both eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.73,
      "end_seconds": 305.43,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.21,
      "end_seconds": 335.32,
      "duration_seconds": 25.11,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is a refractive problem or early cataracts. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. It could also be diabetic eye changes, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.48,
      "end_seconds": 339.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "I mean, doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.79,
      "end_seconds": 356.35,
      "duration_seconds": 15.56,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a refractive problem or early cataracts is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had blurry vision for nearly five years, mild, and no eye pain or floaters."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.28,
      "end_seconds": 358.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.25,
      "end_seconds": 362.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.62,
      "end_seconds": 364.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.37,
      "end_seconds": 389.59,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. I'd like to arrange a dilated eye examination for blurred vision. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 392.56,
      "end_seconds": 397.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Hmm, sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.04,
      "end_seconds": 401.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an eye pressure check for blurred vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.23,
      "end_seconds": 406.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I mean, alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 408.31,
      "end_seconds": 428.83,
      "duration_seconds": 20.52,
      "text": "Get a proper glasses test, and keep your sugar and blood pressure well controlled for your eyes. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 430.3,
      "end_seconds": 431.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 432.68,
      "end_seconds": 442.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "If you get sudden loss of vision or a curtain across your sight, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 443.98,
      "end_seconds": 445.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 446.2,
      "end_seconds": 449.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Please come and see me in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 449.43,
      "end_seconds": 452.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Okay, uh, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 452.61,
      "end_seconds": 456.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 457.5,
      "end_seconds": 461.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 462.86,
      "end_seconds": 468.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "So, yes, exactly right. Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 469.73,
      "end_seconds": 472.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Uh, thanks so much, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 473.42,
      "end_seconds": 475.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}